1
00:00:08,679 --> 00:00:10,439
Guards!

2
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,800
Do you remember this?

3
00:00:20,079 --> 00:00:21,760
I always remember

4
00:00:22,039 --> 00:00:23,160
when you beat me,

5
00:00:23,519 --> 00:00:24,879
you said,

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,120
to be an emperor,

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,519
you must suppress your desires

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:30,960
and cut off your affection.

9
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,000
Today,

10
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:40,000
I'll repay you for this lesson.

11
00:00:42,799 --> 00:00:44,479
Don't worry, old man.

12
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,600
I won't kill you so soon.

13
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:49,520
I want you

14
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,359
to feel

15
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,840
the pain

16
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,159
I've suffered over the years.

17
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:04,519
Yexuan, stop!

18
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:02,799
Move aside!

19
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,640
He's already on his last breath.

20
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:06,079
If you kill him now,

21
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,799
the charge of regicide

22
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,120
won't just fall on Gu Jiachen,

23
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,439
but all of you!

24
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:11,479
So what?

25
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,439
Do you think

26
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,280
I truly care about the throne?

27
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:17,240
I hate

28
00:02:17,719 --> 00:02:19,599
hypocrites the most.

29
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,360
The old man is one.

30
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,039
Gu Jiachen is another.

31
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:25,560
And you.

32
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:28,000
You always pretend to help me

33
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,840
but actually help Gu Jiachen to deceive me.

34
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,240
Who of you

35
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:32,960
cares about my feelings?

36
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,719
You all deserve to die!

37
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,319
Ye Xuan, Ye Xuan.

38
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,759
Ye Xuan, it's my fault.

39
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,400
Ye Xuan, listen to me.

40
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:43,840
I did think at first

41
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,319
that you were part of Gu Jiachen.

42
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:46,719
I thought my mission

43
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,120
was to bring him back

44
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,360
and suppress you.

45
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,319
But now I know

46
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,400
you are not a part of him.

47
00:02:56,199 --> 00:02:57,280
You are him,

48
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,439
and you are you.

49
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:03,039
We are all living individuals

50
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,960
and should not be ignored by anyone.

51
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,599
You're so smooth.

52
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:09,759
I'm afraid

53
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,120
you'll try to

54
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,759
bring Gu Jiachen back

55
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:14,439
in a while.

56
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:16,080
No.

57
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,240
Shen Li has told me

58
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,919
about the jade belt.

59
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:23,520
I don't know

60
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:25,080
how you became

61
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,240
like this over the years.

62
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,479
But I know

63
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:29,800
you are in pain.

64
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:31,719
You are in pain.

65
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,120
I don't care who you are,

66
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,319
Gu Jiachen,

67
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,120
Ye Xuan,

68
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,400
Fu Yi,

69
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,840
or anyone else.

70
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:47,599
the reason why you appear

71
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:50,360
is to share this pain

72
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,680
and live a better life.

73
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,199
Ye Xuan,

74
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,439
put down the dagger.

75
00:03:56,479 --> 00:03:58,159
Don't let the tragedy continue.

76
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,800
Let's leave here together.

77
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,400
Okay?

78
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,800
It's too late to say anything now.

79
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:07,759
Feng Zhiwei,

80
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:09,759
no one can save you now.

81
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,160
Give me a chance

82
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,519
to save you.

83
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,439
Stop it, Ye Xuan.

84
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,839
Don't hurt her.

85
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,240
If I hadn't

86
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,199
kept you under constant watch,

87
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:56,519
I wouldn't have known

88
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,680
that you would

89
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,560
secretly meet with a woman

90
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,639
from the cold palace.

91
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:01,879
You met her in secret

92
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,560
for ten days,

93
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,839
and even exchanged

94
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:06,560
gifts.

95
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,439
Gu Jiachen!

96
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:08,959
You even wrote poems to express your feelings.

97
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,279
Father,

98
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:12,079
my sister and I

99
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:14,680
did nothing wrong.

100
00:05:14,759 --> 00:05:15,560
Sister?

101
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:17,399
She's your concubine mother!

102
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,519
Gu Jiachen,

103
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,839
you should focus

104
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,279
on the classics

105
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:23,680
and imperial texts,

106
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,040
not on those

107
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:27,600
shameful romantic entanglements!

108
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:30,720
You've disappointed me greatly.

109
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:31,879
You deserve

110
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:35,399
to be bullied by your brothers.

111
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,040
I'll

112
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:38,360
give you another chance.

113
00:05:39,959 --> 00:05:41,399
Kill that woman,

114
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,560
Prove

115
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:45,560
you're still my good son,

116
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:47,720
and I'll spare you.

117
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,680
Father,

118
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:55,160
this

119
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,519
was entirely my doing.

120
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:58,920
It has nothing to do with my sister.

121
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,839
I approached her first.

122
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,759
I shouldn't

123
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,319
have been so impulsive.

124
00:06:05,199 --> 00:06:05,800
Please,

125
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,879
spare her.

126
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,720
Punish me.

127
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:13,399
Stop!

128
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:30,839
Guards!

129
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,839
Go to the Cold Palace,

130
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,759
find that woman,

131
00:06:34,079 --> 00:06:34,959
and execute her by death penalty.

132
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:36,319
No need to report back.

133
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:39,319
Hurry up! Execute her now!

134
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:39,839
Yes, Your Majesty.

135
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:40,480
Wait!

136
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:47,519
You...

137
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:48,319
You filthy bastard!

138
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:50,120
Who allowed you...

139
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,360
If you kill her,

140
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:55,480
I will definitely kill you!

141
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,120
You better remember this.

142
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,800
I was born because of her.

143
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,319
If she dies,

144
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:05,160
you'll die a more miserable death.

145
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,360
It turns out that

146
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:10,079
you suffer from dissociative identity disorder

147
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:14,040
because of me.

148
00:07:17,199 --> 00:07:17,680
Sister.

149
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:19,399
Sister.

150
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,600
Chen.

151
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:25,800
You're worthy of being the Holy Maiden.

152
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,639
You actually found this place.

153
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:29,800
Ruan Che.

154
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,680
What happened just now?

155
00:07:33,319 --> 00:07:35,920
This is our inner world,

156
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,519
and also the memories

157
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,439
they forgot.

158
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,439
Sister,

159
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:46,279
six years ago,

160
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,480
your painting

161
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:49,519
was like a seed

162
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,600
planted in this body.

163
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,120
After that,

164
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:54,720
we were born.

165
00:07:55,879 --> 00:07:56,519
Ye Xuan

166
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:58,399
was born of anger.

167
00:07:59,199 --> 00:07:59,720
Fu Yi

168
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,680
was born of freedom.

169
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:03,839
Gu Jiachen

170
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,519
is the one who tries his best

171
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,000
to survive

172
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,959
and protect you.

173
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,000
It turns out

174
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,879
that it's really my fault.

175
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,360
Sister,

176
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,000
it's not your fault.

177
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,600
On the contrary,

178
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,079
it was because of you

179
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:26,800
that the unbearable pain

180
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,199
had a chance to branch out.

181
00:08:29,199 --> 00:08:30,639
They flowed into different souls

182
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,200
and were caught by different personalities,

183
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,240
and carry on

184
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:34,440
living.

185
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:35,919
That's how we

186
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,600
got to know you.

187
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,200
My purpose

188
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,080
is to remember

189
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,919
every memory related to you.

190
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:46,600
Now that you know

191
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,679
our names,

192
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:49,960
it's

193
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:51,440
time for everything to end.

194
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:53,559
What?

195
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,480
Sister,

196
00:08:59,679 --> 00:09:00,679
thank you for remembering me.

197
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,720
Now it's time to give back the memory

198
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,200
to them.

199
00:09:05,919 --> 00:09:06,519
Ruan Che

200
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:26,240
I'll give Gu Jiachen back to you.

201
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:49,120
By the order of the Noble Consort,

202
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,440
I'm here to check on His Majesty.

203
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:52,440
Open the door!

204
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,120
You dare to enter

205
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,240
the Palace without permission!

206
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,639
Are you trying to rebel?

207
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,399
I'm here

208
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:03,919
on behalf of the Noble Consort.

209
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,039
And you're blocking me?

210
00:10:05,279 --> 00:10:06,320
I'd like to know

211
00:10:06,759 --> 00:10:07,759
what right you have

212
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,399
to defy the Princess's orders?

213
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:10,360
His Highness

214
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,639
is discussing matters with His Majesty.

215
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:13,720
Without his permission,

216
00:10:14,159 --> 00:10:15,240
no one enters.

217
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,480
I have no time for this.

218
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,039
Move aside.

219
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:21,120
Are you seeking death?

220
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:24,279
Who is seeking death?

221
00:10:29,639 --> 00:10:30,240
Your Highness,

222
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,720
you bring a blade

223
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,440
to pay respects to His Majesty?

224
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:36,320
Princess,

225
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,759
is this how you were taught?

226
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:40,320
I dare not.

227
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:41,960
I'm just

228
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:44,399
worried about His Majesty.

229
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:46,159
His Majesty just fell asleep after taking medicine,

230
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,360
and was woken up by you.

231
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:50,080
His Majesty asked me to come out and ask

232
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:51,559
who

233
00:10:51,879 --> 00:10:53,840
dares to make noise with weapons in front of the Palace

234
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,399
and disturb His Majesty.

235
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:56,600
Your Highness, please calm down.

236
00:10:56,759 --> 00:10:57,480
I dare not.

237
00:10:58,919 --> 00:10:59,320
Get out.

238
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:01,320
Yes.

239
00:11:02,399 --> 00:11:02,759
Go.

240
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:04,039
Yes.

241
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:15,799
Gu Jiachen,

242
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,559
I'm back.

243
00:11:42,399 --> 00:11:43,559
I've heard your words,

244
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,799
and my hand

245
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,080
has been bandaged.

246
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:49,799
But your wound

247
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:51,919
is stuck to your clothes.

248
00:11:52,399 --> 00:11:53,279
Even if you're afraid of pain,

249
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,200
you have to tear them off.

250
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:58,679
Come on.

251
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,759
Does it hurt?

252
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,159
No.

253
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,799
Gu Jiachen,

254
00:12:49,799 --> 00:12:50,879
After what happened today,

255
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:52,519
do you remember

256
00:12:52,679 --> 00:12:53,799
anything from the past?

257
00:12:56,919 --> 00:12:57,440
No.

258
00:12:58,639 --> 00:12:59,399
[That's strange.]

259
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,360
[Didn't Ruan Che say he would]

260
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,360
[return all the memories to him?]

261
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,200
[Why does Gu Jiachen still remember]

262
00:13:05,679 --> 00:13:06,919
[nothing?]

263
00:13:08,159 --> 00:13:09,200
I'll get you some water.

264
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,399
Sister.
